# plus a much larger CVE set overall — not an improvement.
# Why not exploitable: this affects gRPC servers using gRPC's authorization
# API to gate access by HTTP/2 :path. cAdvisor doesn't run a gRPC server —
# it exposes an HTTP Prometheus metrics endpoint on the internal Docker
